#start
High stress will lead to inflammation which will then subsequently lead to increased risk for cardiovascular disease. We therefore gathered single cell rna-seq/atac-seq data from PBMCs from individuals 50+ years old. These were collected in batches of 12, with 4 batches total. The cells were either untreated, stimulated with LPS, or stimulated with LPS and treated with dexamethasone. 

Note:Some batches do not contain all conditions. One batch does not contain atac-seq (failed).

Questions to answer:
QC - did the cells respond to LPS, LPS+Dex
QC - Check marker genes expression with cell labels
What genes are differentially expressed
Are any genes associated with covariates such as age/sex
Do any of the age associations change with LPS
are any genes associated with psychosocial variables
are any genes associated with cardiovascular variables
Do any associations correlate with clinical outcomes

